WEBVTT

00:13.572 --> 00:20.532
<b>Daemons of the Shadow Realm</b>

01:31.152 --> 01:33.032
<b>Akio-kun was a traitor?</b>

01:33.032 --> 01:37.452
<b>Yup. He tried to kill Asa.</b>

01:38.062 --> 01:41.862
<b>He was probably talked 
into it by an outsider.</b>

01:41.862 --> 01:43.632
<b>When the master returned,</b>

01:43.632 --> 01:46.962
<b>we were supposed to extract 
information from him and kill him.</b>

01:46.962 --> 01:50.982
<b>Why does Dad always jump 
right to killing people?</b>

01:50.982 --> 01:53.162
<b>We lived and worked together.</b>

01:53.542 --> 01:56.672
<b>Why can't he look for 
a way to let him live?</b>

01:59.242 --> 02:00.422
<b>It's just not possible.</b>

02:01.422 --> 02:03.532
<b>Still feel like letting Akio live?</b>

02:06.142 --> 02:07.952
<b>It's Kawai, the gardener.</b>

02:09.072 --> 02:13.052
<b>His Daemons are strays now 
that their master's dead.</b>

02:17.562 --> 02:20.492
<b>Will someone form a contract with them?</b>

02:22.452 --> 02:25.992
<b>Uh, may I?</b>

02:26.302 --> 02:31.362
<b>They were close with my Heave-Ho. 
I think they'd be compatible.</b>

02:49.252 --> 02:50.342
<b>Excuse me.</b>

02:50.642 --> 02:55.782
<b>Pair name, Gokko-Itachi. 
Currently no individual names.</b>

02:55.782 --> 02:58.322
<b>Previous master, Kawai Sanosuke.</b>

02:58.322 --> 03:04.122
<b>He was killed while trying to 
stop Kuroya Akio from escaping.</b>

03:04.122 --> 03:05.992
<b>There you have it.</b>

03:06.582 --> 03:11.342
<b>But he was like family. 
Why would he kill him?</b>

03:11.592 --> 03:15.582
<b>The police would enter the manor 
to investigate an unnatural death.</b>

03:15.862 --> 03:19.352
<b>We'll have to say he disappeared.</b>

03:20.142 --> 03:25.192
<b>I brought in Kawai. He had no family.</b>

03:25.192 --> 03:27.162
<b>It'll be easy to make him disappear.</b>

03:28.232 --> 03:29.642
<b>Jin-kun!</b>

03:30.972 --> 03:32.692
<b>You can't do this!</b>

03:32.982 --> 03:35.382
<b>He worked for us for years.</b>

03:35.382 --> 03:38.022
<b>We have to give him a proper funeral.</b>

03:38.022 --> 03:40.782
<b>It'd be too sad not to, Dad!</b>

03:41.802 --> 03:43.032
<b>Dad!</b>

03:44.132 --> 03:49.292
<b>Wasn't it your strictness that 
made Akio-kun close himself off?</b>

03:49.602 --> 03:51.872
<b>You treat people like family</b>

03:51.872 --> 03:55.352
<b>but don't hesitate to cut them 
out when something happens.</b>

03:55.352 --> 03:57.552
<b>You kill people for 
opposing you even once.</b>

03:58.342 --> 04:02.442
<b>If you'd been less rigid 
and opened your heart,</b>

04:02.442 --> 04:06.892
<b>maybe he would've told us why 
he betrayed the Kagemori clan.</b>

04:07.172 --> 04:10.462
<b>Maybe he wouldn't have 
taken that last step.</b>

04:11.742 --> 04:14.592
<b>Maybe Kawai-san wouldn't have died.</b>

04:14.592 --> 04:15.152
<b>Hikaru!</b>

04:17.882 --> 04:19.112
<b>You know, Sensei-chan...</b>

04:19.432 --> 04:23.862
<b>I like your manga because there 
aren't any bad people in them.</b>

04:24.722 --> 04:31.062
<b>Reality sucks, so reading your 
manga makes me feel safe.</b>

04:31.062 --> 04:35.922
<b>The people in your worlds 
wouldn't try to get rid of me.</b>

04:36.742 --> 04:40.322
<b>But reality sucks.</b>

04:40.322 --> 04:47.142
<b>It's full of unbelievably 
shitty people, including me.</b>

04:47.612 --> 04:49.712
<b>Despite being a piece of shit,</b>

04:49.712 --> 04:53.442
<b>I want to protect the Kagemori 
clan because it's where I belong.</b>

04:53.832 --> 04:58.482
<b>I want you to keep drawing your 
happy manga in a safe place.</b>

04:59.442 --> 05:03.192
<b>I want Asa to live a 
peaceful and normal life.</b>

05:04.102 --> 05:10.242
<b>Akio chose the parents who abandoned him 
over the Kagemoris and betrayed us.</b>

05:10.642 --> 05:13.262
<b>I don't know how important 
they are to him,</b>

05:13.262 --> 05:16.932
<b>but I won't forgive anyone who tries 
to destroy the place where we belong.</b>

05:17.822 --> 05:23.452
<b>I'd even kill my own parents 
if they tried to do that!</b>

05:23.452 --> 05:29.832
<b>You can be lenient with shitheads and 
hope they'll change, but they rarely do.</b>

05:29.832 --> 05:33.252
<b>Kill them before it's too late.</b>

05:33.972 --> 05:35.482
<b>That's all you can do.</b>

05:37.812 --> 05:38.982
<b>I'm sorry.</b>

05:39.902 --> 05:40.722
<b>Asa?</b>

05:41.112 --> 05:43.362
<b>Don't leave Asa-san by herself.</b>

05:43.362 --> 05:44.402
<b>I know!</b>

05:44.792 --> 05:46.372
<b>Damn it, Asa! Wait!</b>

05:46.832 --> 05:48.372
<b>Hey, Haruo.</b>

05:49.262 --> 05:52.162
<b>Why do humans betray their friends?</b>

05:52.562 --> 05:55.932
<b>Daemons never betray their partners.</b>

05:58.112 --> 06:00.972
<b>Asa, you can't go off by yourself!</b>

06:00.972 --> 06:03.302
<b>Akio might still be hiding somewhere!</b>

06:04.392 --> 06:05.622
<b>Asa...</b>

06:06.272 --> 06:09.122
<b>Akio-san, why?</b>

06:09.772 --> 06:12.072
<b>You could've just tried to kill me.</b>

06:12.782 --> 06:15.332
<b>Kawai-san wasn't a combatant.</b>

06:16.042 --> 06:19.522
<b>He was just a gardener 
who never killed anyone.</b>

06:19.972 --> 06:22.492
<b>He never wished for anyone to die.</b>

06:22.982 --> 06:25.592
<b>He was just living a normal life.</b>

06:26.582 --> 06:27.982
<b>It's my fault.</b>

06:28.812 --> 06:30.062
<b>Idiot!</b>

06:31.852 --> 06:33.622
<b>Like hell it is!</b>

06:33.622 --> 06:36.842
<b>It was the people trying to 
exploit your power who did this!</b>

06:37.062 --> 06:38.692
<b>It's not your fault, Asa!</b>

06:38.692 --> 06:42.172
<b>Even Yuru said to stop 
apologizing for everything!</b>

06:42.172 --> 06:44.922
<b>The next time you apologize for some 
dumb shit, I'll kick your ass!</b>

06:44.922 --> 06:46.542
<b>I mean, I already did!</b>

06:50.932 --> 06:52.652
<b>Sorry, Gabby-chan.</b>

06:53.892 --> 06:56.312
<b>Episode 24
Higashi Village
and Nishino Village</b>

06:54.442 --> 06:56.302
<b>What did I just say?!</b>

07:33.072 --> 07:35.752
<b>Father's not here.</b>

07:36.892 --> 07:38.272
<b>I'm alone.</b>

07:38.682 --> 07:43.272
<b>I have to clean this up by myself.</b>

07:43.862 --> 07:50.782
<b>This bandit was trying to kill me.</b>

08:00.642 --> 08:04.302
<b>Don't hesitate. Don't waver.</b>

08:04.312 --> 08:06.292
<b>Father's not here.</b>

08:06.292 --> 08:08.822
<b>Nobody will clean this up for me.</b>

08:08.822 --> 08:10.552
<b>I have to do it myself.</b>

08:14.342 --> 08:15.622
<b>In the mountains...</b>

08:18.652 --> 08:19.872
<b>I'm alone.</b>

08:25.992 --> 08:29.632
<b>Huh? Where am I?</b>

08:30.892 --> 08:35.772
<b>Oh, right. I was sleeping in the 
place where they store... futons...</b>

08:37.052 --> 08:40.032
<b>Are you feeling better, Yuru?</b>

08:41.232 --> 08:43.342
<b>Don't scare me like that, Left!</b>

08:44.012 --> 08:45.782
<b>What are you doing there?</b>

08:45.782 --> 08:46.832
<b>Watching over you.</b>

08:47.522 --> 08:53.202
<b>I still have some trouble moving, but I 
can watch you forever from this posture.</b>

08:49.392 --> 08:50.442
<b>Hup.</b>

08:53.202 --> 08:55.672
<b>S-Sure, thanks.</b>

08:57.372 --> 09:00.022
<b>Yuru-san, you're awake. How do you feel?</b>

09:00.282 --> 09:04.272
<b>My body feels lighter. What time is it?</b>

09:04.272 --> 09:06.422
<b>It's past noon.</b>

09:07.872 --> 09:09.312
<b>Good morning.</b>

09:09.312 --> 09:11.612
<b>Or good afternoon, I guess.</b>

09:11.612 --> 09:13.322
<b>Your color's back.</b>

09:13.632 --> 09:15.772
<b>Yuru-niichan, are you okay?</b>

09:15.772 --> 09:17.242
<b>How's your shoulder?</b>

09:17.242 --> 09:18.282
<b>And your fever?</b>

09:18.632 --> 09:21.732
<b>You're feeling better? Good.</b>

09:32.652 --> 09:34.122
<b>What was that for?</b>

09:34.122 --> 09:35.252
<b>Did you sleep well?</b>

09:36.982 --> 09:38.762
<b>I had an unpleasant dream.</b>

09:38.762 --> 09:42.742
<b>Yeah? Have something good 
to eat and forget about it.</b>

09:42.742 --> 09:45.692
<b>All right. Let's get a late lunch going.</b>

09:46.452 --> 09:49.362
<b>We can all eat together.</b>

10:04.002 --> 10:06.182
<b>Took you long enough, Jin-chan.</b>

10:06.182 --> 10:07.652
<b>Could you clean this up?</b>

10:10.672 --> 10:12.672
<b>Are they Higashi Village agents?</b>

10:12.672 --> 10:17.012
<b>Apparently. They killed Asa.</b>

10:19.822 --> 10:22.622
<b>She gained the power of Break.</b>

10:24.802 --> 10:28.912
<b>I'm sorry... Jin-san.</b>

10:30.272 --> 10:33.822
<b>I'm sorry you have to clean this up.</b>

10:34.892 --> 10:36.092
<b>I'm sorry.</b>

10:37.042 --> 10:38.382
<b>I'm sorry.</b>

10:39.072 --> 10:40.392
<b>I'm sorry.</b>

10:41.402 --> 10:43.712
<b>I'm sorry.</b>

10:48.832 --> 10:53.322
<b>It's all right. It's my job to clean up.</b>

10:53.322 --> 10:55.622
<b>You don't need to apologize.</b>

10:56.202 --> 11:00.322
<b>Let me handle the rest. 
Take a mental break.</b>

11:10.612 --> 11:12.652
<b>Gabby-chan, you're heavy.</b>

11:14.772 --> 11:17.002
<b>Did you sleep well?</b>

11:20.062 --> 11:23.362
<b>I had a bad dream.</b>

11:24.192 --> 11:28.072
<b>Yeah? Have something to 
eat and forget about it.</b>

11:28.752 --> 11:31.582
<b>Is there anything in the kitchen?</b>

11:33.732 --> 11:36.452
<b>Good morning. Or good afternoon, I guess.</b>

11:36.452 --> 11:40.482
<b>Natsuki-neesan, were you guarding me?</b>

11:40.482 --> 11:45.262
<b>They might strike again while our 
guard's down after that incident.</b>

11:45.742 --> 11:47.322
<b>I'm glad nothing happened.</b>

11:47.322 --> 11:48.302
<b>Were you up all night?</b>

11:48.302 --> 11:51.572
<b>Yeah. I'm going to take a shower.</b>

11:51.572 --> 11:53.282
<b>Take over for me, Gabby-chan.</b>

11:53.282 --> 11:54.562
<b>Sure thing.</b>

11:54.562 --> 11:55.902
<b>Natsuki-neesan.</b>

11:57.792 --> 11:58.802
<b>I'm so—</b>

12:03.172 --> 12:04.872
<b>Thank you.</b>

12:06.522 --> 12:11.702
<b>Once I'm out of the shower,
we're doing math lessons as usual.</b>

12:11.702 --> 12:13.032
<b>What?!</b>

12:13.032 --> 12:15.002
<b>At least let her rest today!</b>

12:15.282 --> 12:18.452
<b>All-nighters are bad for 
your skin, Natsuki-chan.</b>

12:18.452 --> 12:20.262
<b>You should sleep a little, Natsuki.</b>

12:20.262 --> 12:22.562
<b>Yeah! Go to sleep, Natsuki-nee!</b>

12:26.292 --> 12:27.322
<b>Fine.</b>

12:27.682 --> 12:31.612
<b>I'll get plenty of sleep once you've 
finished your math for the day.</b>

12:31.932 --> 12:35.192
<b>Hurry up and solve those 
problems so I can sleep.</b>

12:35.192 --> 12:36.702
<b>You're a monster!</b>

12:36.692 --> 12:37.692
Easy
Mathematics I

12:37.442 --> 12:41.112
<b>I wonder if I could 
"Break" these problems.</b>

12:41.112 --> 12:44.582
<b>Don't use a legendary
Daemon on crap like that!</b>

12:46.532 --> 12:48.032
<b>Daemons of the Shadow Realm</b>

12:54.522 --> 12:55.652
<b>Natsuki.</b>

12:59.112 --> 13:02.662
<b>Jin-san said to take 
the rest of the day off.</b>

13:06.852 --> 13:09.422
<b>Haruo, let's drink together.</b>

13:09.422 --> 13:11.882
<b>We'll drink and sleep first.</b>

13:12.212 --> 13:14.802
<b>Then we'll think about Akio.</b>

13:15.602 --> 13:17.582
<b>Staying up all night and drinking?</b>

13:17.582 --> 13:19.552
<b>That's hell on your skin, Natsuki.</b>

13:21.452 --> 13:24.242
<b>I'll put you to sleep 
right now, Haruo.</b>

13:24.242 --> 13:25.072
<b>Don't.</b>

13:31.322 --> 13:32.322
<b>All right!</b>

13:32.682 --> 13:33.932
<b>What's he doing?</b>

13:33.932 --> 13:35.072
<b>He got an electronic dictionary.</b>

13:35.322 --> 13:38.962
<b>I gave it to him so he can look 
up words he doesn't know.</b>

13:39.322 --> 13:40.902
<b>Since coming down here,</b>

13:39.332 --> 13:41.332
m 0 0 l 200 0 200 110 0 110

13:39.332 --> 13:41.332
tsugai [noun]
1) When two or more objects combine to
form a pair
2) A male and female pair of animals
A couple
3) A hinge or joint
4) An opportunity, chance, or catalyst

13:40.902 --> 13:44.212
<b>I've encountered lots of words
I can read but don't understand.</b>

13:44.212 --> 13:46.852
<b>Now I don't have to ask 
people all the time.</b>

13:46.852 --> 13:49.832
<b>I see. You're using hiragana input mode.</b>

13:49.832 --> 13:50.712
<b>Okay.</b>

13:51.262 --> 13:55.222
<b>Yuru-san, what did you 
study in the village?</b>

13:55.222 --> 13:58.302
<b>I read the texts Dera-san brought 
from the outside world,</b>

13:58.842 --> 14:00.142
<b>like Sun Tzu.</b>

14:00.142 --> 14:03.532
<b>That's amazing, Yuru-san! 
You're an educated barbarian!</b>

14:03.532 --> 14:06.562
<b><i>I only said I read it.
I never said I understood it.</i></b>

14:06.822 --> 14:10.592
<b>Uh, what? How does this work?</b>

14:10.592 --> 14:13.882
<b>I'm not sure either,
but that's what it does.</b>

14:17.312 --> 14:18.382
<b>Here.</b>

14:18.382 --> 14:19.852
<b>Thank you.</b>

14:19.852 --> 14:24.192
<b>Azami, you must be confused after 
coming down here so suddenly.</b>

14:24.192 --> 14:25.392
<b>Are you okay?</b>

14:25.842 --> 14:26.662
<b>Yeah.</b>

14:26.982 --> 14:29.782
<b>I don't know what's going on,</b>

14:29.782 --> 14:36.192
<b>but I've been confused for so long that 
I've gotten used to being confused.</b>

14:36.192 --> 14:37.792
<b>I know exactly what you mean!</b>

14:38.112 --> 14:39.912
<b>Also, the rice is good.</b>

14:39.912 --> 14:40.802
<b>Right?</b>

14:40.802 --> 14:43.522
<b>Also, the cold box is amazing.</b>

14:41.492 --> 14:44.762
<b>I'm glad Azami-chan's 
feeling a little better.</b>

14:43.522 --> 14:44.882
<b>The cold box?</b>

14:44.762 --> 14:45.792
<b>Yeah.</b>

14:44.882 --> 14:45.632
<b>Yeah.</b>

14:45.632 --> 14:46.932
<b>Oh, the cold box.</b>

14:45.792 --> 14:49.492
<b>But she probably wants to 
go back to the village.</b>

14:46.932 --> 14:47.502
<b>Yeah.</b>

14:47.502 --> 14:47.942
<b>Right.</b>

14:47.942 --> 14:48.682
<b>It's full of food.</b>

14:48.682 --> 14:49.492
<b>That's amazing.</b>

14:49.492 --> 14:50.172
<b>Yeah, it's amazing.</b>

14:50.172 --> 14:50.592
<b>Yup.</b>

14:50.292 --> 14:53.412
<b>I hope Mom's okay.</b>

14:50.592 --> 14:53.332
<b>The ice doesn't taste good, though.</b>

14:54.842 --> 14:56.232
<b>Cheer up.</b>

14:56.232 --> 14:59.242
<b>You'll drive away all your 
luck by looking so gloomy.</b>

14:59.242 --> 15:00.872
<b>Right and Left.</b>

15:02.032 --> 15:03.492
<b>Did you reattach your limbs?</b>

15:03.772 --> 15:06.512
<b>Yup, good as new.</b>

15:06.512 --> 15:08.542
<b>We're still not in top shape, though.</b>

15:08.922 --> 15:12.382
<b>The stone adhesive Dera 
bought worked well.</b>

15:11.052 --> 15:15.802
Stone Adhesive King

15:11.052 --> 15:15.802
Stone Adhesive King

15:11.052 --> 15:15.802
Super Strong!!

15:11.052 --> 15:15.802
Super Strong!!

15:12.382 --> 15:15.132
<b>With this stuff, we can get cut
all we want, no problem.</b>

15:15.812 --> 15:18.602
<b>Try not to get cut if you can avoid it.</b>

15:19.702 --> 15:20.862
<b>Huh?</b>

15:21.702 --> 15:24.302
<b>By the way, where's Dera-san?</b>

15:42.932 --> 15:45.222
<b>Hey, buddy. Did you lose?</b>

15:45.222 --> 15:46.172
<b>You, too?</b>

15:46.172 --> 15:50.392
<b>I was trying to earn money 
to support the kids.</b>

15:50.392 --> 15:53.492
<b>I'm trying to pay off some debt.</b>

15:53.492 --> 15:56.932
<b>I even took out a loan
so I could place a bet.</b>

15:57.172 --> 16:01.682
<b>We'll make up for it with the 
next race for your kids.</b>

16:01.682 --> 16:02.682
<b>Yeah.</b>

16:03.922 --> 16:05.422
<b>Scumbags.</b>

16:04.312 --> 16:05.422
<b><i>Scumbags.</i></b>

16:05.422 --> 16:08.882
<b>Time to take out another loan!</b>

