16:14.772 --> 16:16.252
<b>Oh, man.</b>

16:16.252 --> 16:17.522
<b>Yikes.</b>

16:17.522 --> 16:19.522
<b>Danno</b>

16:18.722 --> 16:22.012
<b>Higashi Village's agents 
have been summoned.</b>

16:22.012 --> 16:25.042
<b>They're calling everyone 
with an official role.</b>

16:25.382 --> 16:28.102
<b>This message is from the bandits.</b>

16:28.102 --> 16:29.532
<b>What? Them?</b>

16:29.892 --> 16:32.582
<b>They're definitely planning 
to put you through the wringer</b>

16:32.582 --> 16:36.142
<b>for the Fujimurayama warehouse incident 
and demand we hand over Yuru-kun.</b>

16:36.372 --> 16:38.142
<b>Yup.</b>

16:38.442 --> 16:41.412
