all of them a lesson?</b>

16:41.412 --> 16:42.752
<b>You can't.</b>

16:42.752 --> 16:45.722
<b>Yeah, listen to Left.</b>

16:46.022 --> 16:49.192
<b>We haven't fully recovered yet,
so we can't go.</b>

16:49.192 --> 16:52.492
<b>It's not fair for you to 
go hunting by yourself.</b>

16:52.732 --> 16:53.992
<b>I see.</b>

16:54.442 --> 16:58.252
<b>Then we'll all go teach them 
a lesson once you're better.</b>

16:58.252 --> 17:00.242
<b><i>Don't make it sound like 
a fun little outing!</i></b>

17:00.612 --> 17:04.992
<b>Don't. A lot of Higashi Village agents 
with official roles are Daemon Wielders.</b>

17:05.252 --> 17:07.702
<b>Which is why I won't be attending.</b>

17:07.702 --> 17:09.292
<b>No fair, Dera-san!</b>

17:09.292 --> 17:13.562
<b>If I skip, too, they'll be suspicious!</b>

17:18.652 --> 17:22.222
<b>Hey. How's it going?</b>

17:22.492 --> 17:24.232
<b>Hey, gravedigger.</b>

17:24.232 --> 17:26.002
<b>Good to see you, Hana-chan.</b>

17:26.002 --> 17:27.222
<b>You're still alive, huh?</b>

17:27.602 --> 17:30.172
<b>Have you heard from Tadera?</b>

17:30.172 --> 17:33.142
<b>Nope. He's not here?</b>

17:33.142 --> 17:36.892
<b>Nah. He won't even respond 
to messages. He's gone dark.</b>

17:36.892 --> 17:40.572
<b>Really? I wonder if he's 
got something to hide.</b>

17:40.572 --> 17:42.822
<b>I ran into him at the 
Fujimurayama warehouse.</b>

17:42.822 --> 17:48.072
<b>He said he wouldn't hand over 
Yuru or help Higashi Village.</b>

17:48.072 --> 17:50.412
<b>So he betrayed Higashi Village?</b>

17:50.412 --> 17:54.582
<b>I bet he's planning to use 
the Seal kid for himself.</b>

17:54.582 --> 17:56.222
<b>Wow, he sucks.</b>

17:56.222 --> 17:59.432
<b>We'd better teach that turd 
a lesson if we find him.</b>

17:59.722 --> 18:02.172
<b><i>She really hates him.</i></b>

18:05.972 --> 18:07.682
<b>The president's here.</b>

18:22.332 --> 18:24.622
<b>Is everyone here?</b>

18:24.902 --> 18:26.392
<b>Tadera's missing.</b>

18:27.052 --> 18:28.532
<b>Figures.</b>

18:28.952 --> 18:30.332
<b>Good evening.</b>

18:30.762 --> 18:32.212
<b>Good to see you again.</b>

18:32.802 --> 18:35.342
<b>Hey, it's a message from Jiro.</b>

18:34.132 --> 18:36.622
president's daemons well

18:35.342 --> 18:36.612
<b>President?</b>

18:36.992 --> 18:40.452
<b>He's the leader of Higashi 
Village's agents down here.</b>

18:40.452 --> 18:44.742
<b>He's the one who assigns us work, 
so I'd rather not fight him,</b>

18:44.742 --> 18:47.392
<b>but he also wants to 
acquire Break and Seal</b>

18:47.392 --> 18:50.272
<b>so Higashi Village can 
take over the world.</b>

18:51.382 --> 18:58.162
<b>I heard Tadera Ryu has taken Yuru
and gone into hiding, gravedigger.</b>

18:58.162 --> 19:00.332
<b>Yeah, apparently.</b>

19:00.672 --> 19:03.102
<b>You haven't heard from him?</b>

19:03.102 --> 19:05.552
<b>Like I told the bandits,</b>

19:05.552 --> 19:07.552
<b>I just brought Yuru-kun down the mountain</b>

19:07.552 --> 19:09.912
<b>and dropped them off 
near Dera-san's place.</b>

19:09.912 --> 19:11.582
<b>I haven't heard from them since.</b>

19:11.862 --> 19:17.482
<b>Why didn't you tell us you brought 
Yuru out of the village?</b>

19:17.482 --> 19:20.712
<b>It's a good thing we heard 
about it through the shaman.</b>

19:20.712 --> 19:25.092
<b>We almost didn't hear about 
Higashi Village being attacked.</b>

19:25.092 --> 19:26.752
<b>Hey, don't blame me!</b>

19:27.182 --> 19:29.922
<b>Dera-san didn't tell me anything either!</b>

19:29.922 --> 19:31.472
<b>Right.</b>

19:31.942 --> 19:36.532
<b>Higashi Village is a mess 
after the Kagemoris attacked,</b>

19:36.532 --> 19:41.552
<b>Asa is with the Kagemoris and 
has already acquired Break,</b>

19:41.552 --> 19:44.022
<b>and Yuru is down here.</b>

19:44.022 --> 19:46.352
<b>The bandits were nearly wiped out.</b>

19:46.352 --> 19:48.792
<b>The shaman and Tadera are gone.</b>

19:48.792 --> 19:54.792
<b>Almost everyone who knew the way through 
the Higashi Village barrier is gone,</b>

19:54.792 --> 20:00.792
<b>which means waiting for instructions 
from Granny Yamaha will slow us down.</b>

20:02.732 --> 20:08.122
<b>From now on, I should 
take command down here.</b>

20:08.552 --> 20:10.302
president ulterior motives

20:08.802 --> 20:10.302
<b>Ulterior motives?</b>

20:10.302 --> 20:13.202
<b>Huh? What? For Hana-chan?</b>

20:13.202 --> 20:15.732
<b>She'll kill that perv!</b>

20:14.302 --> 20:16.562
wants to take over higashi village

20:15.732 --> 20:20.822
<b>Oh, that kind of ulterior motive. Whew.</b>

20:20.822 --> 20:25.662
<b>First, find Tadera and track down Yuru.</b>

20:25.662 --> 20:26.812
<b>What if he resists?</b>

20:27.122 --> 20:31.202
<b>He doesn't have Daemons. We can 
just throw combat Daemons at him.</b>

20:32.202 --> 20:33.362
<b>Jiro?</b>

20:34.002 --> 20:35.322
<b>What is that?</b>

20:41.312 --> 20:44.222
<b>They're not... 
potentially dangerous objects.</b>

20:44.542 --> 20:47.462
<b>Are these Daemon relics?</b>

20:47.462 --> 20:48.752
<b>They're Daemons.</b>

20:49.072 --> 20:53.452
<b>They're active. 
We sense souls inside them.</b>

20:53.992 --> 20:55.972
<b>Whose Daemons are these?</b>

20:55.972 --> 20:58.332
<b>What were they doing here?</b>

20:58.332 --> 20:59.382
<b>Who knows?</b>

20:59.382 --> 21:01.352
<b>Someone form a contract with them.</b>

21:23.012 --> 21:26.642
<b>Translator:
Sho Stifler

Timer:
Edgar Cruz

Editor:
Salem Alabanza

Quality Control:
Gabriella Alabanza

Final Quality Control:
Michelle Tymon</b>

22:45.792 --> 22:52.092
<b>There's someone who infects Daemon 
relics and blows them up?</b>

22:52.092 --> 22:53.472
<b>Do you know anything?</b>

22:53.472 --> 22:56.862
<b>I have no information 
on anyone like that.</b>

22:56.862 --> 22:59.682
<b>A Daemon unknown to us?</b>

23:00.042 --> 23:04.932
<b>Let's have everyone in the manor check 
if their Daemons have been infected.</b>

23:05.222 --> 23:08.432
<b>Bunbun thinks it might be 
a Daemon from the West.</b>

23:09.162 --> 23:10.552
<b>The West?</b>

23:11.142 --> 23:13.942
<b>The West? Perhaps...</b>

23:13.942 --> 23:16.712
<b>No, it couldn't be.</b>

23:17.312 --> 23:22.082
<b>Nishino Village was destroyed.
It sits at the bottom of a reservoir.</b>

23:30.972 --> 23:37.002
<b>Nishino Village</b>
